do_1 = "Update NewEVMWebSocketServer in rpc/server.go:401 to accept SequencerReceiptOption and assign its Source to SendConfig.SequencerSource after sendConfig at rpc/server.go:444, matching HTTP at rpc/server.go:215 and rpc/server.go:235, so the existing lookup in rpc/send.go:200-210 answers known hashes before acceptance; update the ServerOption documentation at rpc/server.go:48 to describe the supported option."
