do_3 = "Extend TestEVMServerServesSequencerReceiptOption in node/sequencer_rpc_option_test.go:100, which already installs the real Accepter and ReceiptSource at node/sequencer_rpc_option_test.go:162-179 and submits fresh transactions over both transports at node/sequencer_rpc_option_test.go:195-220: resubmit each transaction's identical bytes over HTTP and WebSocket, including cross-transport replay, assert the same hash, byte-identical receipt, unchanged pending nonce and balances, and no additional WAL Accept record, then assert a different signed transaction reusing that nonce is refused with the wrong-sequence JSON-RPC error and leaves the original receipt unchanged."
